* {{ci|Sion}}, while he's in {{ai|Glory in Death|Sion}}
* {{ci|Soraka}}, using {{ai|Astral Infusion|Soraka}}

Besides {{ci|Ivern}}, each of these champions have at least one ability capable of '''restoring their health''':
* {{cai|Crimson Curse|Briar}}, {{ai|Snack Attack|Briar}}, {{ai|Chilling Scream|Briar}}, and {{ai|Certain Death|Briar}}
* {{cai|Goes Where He Pleases|Dr. Mundo}}, {{ai|Infected Bonesaw|Dr. Mundo}}, {{ai|Heart Zapper|Dr. Mundo}}, and {{ai|Maximum Dosage|Dr. Mundo}}
